### **Conversation Summary**

#### **Primary Request and Intent**
The user is developing **«ПТУ-Сошиал»** — a university platform (Spring Boot 3.5.16 + PostgreSQL 17/Redis 7/Mailpit in Docker Compose; React 19/Vite/TS SPA with MUI 7, baked into an Nginx image). Standing rules: keep `docs/spec/AGENTS.md` in permanent context, consult `docs/information_about_project.md` on demand, write **very concise** logs to `docs/agent-log.md` (request → decisions → verification), and do not modify frontend files from the other team unless explicitly asked.

**Earlier this session:** completed task #4 — moving event-review moderation from organizers to the academic office and replacing the rating dropdown with stars. All backend/frontend changes, IT/unit tests, `docs/spec/api.md` updates, and an `agent-log.md` entry were finished. During full `mvn verify`, 3 pre-existing failures remained in `CertificateRequestIT` (stale tests vs. new certificate workflow: `deliveryMethod` required, `APPROVED`→`READY` needs an uploaded PDF); the user has not yet answered whether to fix those.

**Current task (approved with "Proceed."):**
1. Fix the case-opening reel on the frontend: after the spin, the "return to center" moves to an unexpected place and reveals a reward different from the centered card.
2. Create a large demo dataset (several groups, full battle pass, themed cases with working rewards, tasks, etc.) so everything can be demonstrated.

#### **Key Technical Concepts**
- Flyway migrations V1–V19 (`ddl-auto=validate`), dev profile `SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=dev`, `DevDataSeeder` (`@Profile("dev")`, idempotent).
- `DevDataSeeder` currently seeds only: 2 faculties, 2 departments, 3 groups (ИС-21, ИС-22, ЭК-21), 5 disciplines, current semester, office account (`office@ptu.local` / `office12345`), admin (`admin@ptu.local` / `AdminPtu2026!`).
- Case/reward/pass schema in `V10__campus_workflows.sql` and V14/V17/V18:
  - `cases(id, name, description, rarity, price, active, image_data, image_content_type)`
  - `campus_case_reward_catalog(id, case_id, reward_name, cosmetic_type, rarity, weight, image_data, image_content_type)`; cosmetic types: `avatar`, `avatar-frame`, `profile-background`, `badge`; rarities: `Обычный`, `Редкий`, `Эпический`.
  - `campus_pass_reward_catalog(season_id, track free|premium, level 1..50, title, reward_kind case|cosmetic, cosmetic_type, rarity, case_id)`; constraint: `case` requires `case_id` and null `cosmetic_type`; `cosmetic` requires `cosmetic_type` and null `case_id`; unique `(season_id, track, level)`.
  - Current pass catalog has only 50 rows: free at levels not divisible by 5 (cases), premium at levels divisible by 5 (badge cosmetics); no free rewards at 5,10,… and no premium at other levels.
  - `campus_pass_seasons` (one active), `campus_pass_accounts(user_id, season_id, premium_pass_owned)`, `campus_pass_reward_claims`.
  - Pass level = `CampusRules.passLevel(academic_rating)` = `min(50, ceil(exp/20))`; rating is `student_profiles.academic_rating`.
  - Opening a case debits `cases.price` from `wallets.currency_balance`, deletes/decrements the inventory case, and inserts a cosmetic into `inventory_items` (`item_kind`, `cosmetic_type`, `source`, `image_data`, `image_content_type`).
- Tasks: `workspace_tasks(teacher_id, group_id, discipline_id, title, description, due_at, max_points, allow_late_submission, archived, attachment_*)`, `workspace_submissions(task_id, student_id, status SUBMITTED|RETURNED|ACCEPTED, content, grade 2..5, awarded_rating, revision_count, attachment_*, awarded_at)`. API: `/api/workspace/student/tasks`, `/api/workspace/teacher/tasks`, `/api/workspace/teacher/submissions`, `/api/workspace/teacher/tasks` (multipart), `PATCH /api/workspace/teacher/submissions/{id}`.
- Schedule: `campus_schedule_entries(group_id, weekday, start_time, end_time, subject, teacher, room, created_by, discipline_id)`.
- Events: `activities` + `participations` + `reviews` (unique `(activity_id, author_id)`); review status `PENDING_MODERATION`/`APPROVED`/`REJECTED`; event fields: `title, description, type='COMMUNITY', participation_mode, starts_at, ends_at, max_participants, min_participants, required_activation_percent, reward_boa, reward_bua, teacher_id, active, location, category, campus_activity_type ('БОА'|'БУА'), max_points`.
- Certificates: `certificate_requests(student_id, type EDUCATION|INCOME|MILITARY|OTHER, status PENDING|IN_PROGRESS|READY|APPROVED|ISSUED|REJECTED, rejection_reason, delivery_method)`.
- Reel bug root cause: the effect stops the reel at a random offset within ±2 cards (`settleRange = 2 * 156`) of the winner, highlights that random card, then animates ("settles") to `finalOffset`, so the card under the marker changes and the reward looks different. Geometry is hardcoded as pitch 156 (= 148px card + 8px gap), padding 12, half-card 74.

#### **All User Messages**
1. "Твой список задач: изучить /docs/spec/AGENTS.md, прочесть общую информацию по проекту в docs/information_about_project.md, хранить информацию из 1-го файла в контексте на постоянной основе, ко второму - обращаться по мере необходимости. Так же, ты обязан писать логи в agent-log.md … пиши логи очень лаконично и экономно для сохранения токенов. После выполнения этих действий, в рамках теста напиши первый лог."
2. "Фротенд скинул нам свои файлики, в них не лезем, пробуем все поднять через докер, если возникают ошибки - фиксим. Главная задача сейчас - запустить проект"
