.case-reel-track.case-reel-settling { transition: transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.72,.18,1); }
.case-reel-item { flex: 0 0 148px; ... padding: 8px; ... }
.case-reel-marker { position: absolute; inset-block: 0; left: 50%; width: 3px; transform: translateX(-50%); ... }
```
- **`frontend/src/api/campus.ts`** — `openCase(caseId)` → `POST /campus/cases/{caseId}/open`; `InventoryItem` includes `caseId`, `name`, `rarity`, `imageUrl`, `cosmeticType`; `CampusCase` includes `rewards: {name, cosmeticType, rarity, chance, imageUrl}[]`.
- **`backend/src/main/java/com/ptu/backend/dev/DevDataSeeder.java`** — current minimal seeder (JPA repositories); to be extended or accompanied by `DevDemoDataSeeder` (`@Profile("dev")`, `@Order(2)`, `JdbcTemplate` + `PasswordEncoder`), with idempotent inserts.
- **`backend/src/main/java/com/ptu/backend/campus/CampusService.java`** — `moderationQueue` (academic-only, lines ~70–95) with `flaggedWords`; `moderateEventReview` (ACADEMIC_OFFICE, 404/409); `openCase` (lines ~813–847); `insertInventory`/`insertCaseInventory` (lines ~1127–1151); `pass` (line ~685); `claimPassReward` (line ~755); `academicRating` (line ~1211).
- **`docs/agent-log.md`** — last entry "2026-11-10 — Модерация отзывов: учебная часть + звёзды" (format: `## date — title`, bullets `Запрос`, `Решения`, `Проверка`). A new concise entry for the current task is pending.
- **`docs/spec/api.md`** — updated earlier: added "Мероприятия и отзывы (`/api/campus`)" section and corrected the certificates section. No changes needed for the current task, except possibly demo-data doc.

#### **Errors and Fixes**

- **Spring context failed to start**: `ReviewService` had two constructors → "No default constructor found" (`BackendApplicationTests` failed). Fixed by adding `@Autowired` to the public 2-arg constructor.
- **IT compile errors** in `EventReviewModerationIT`: `TypeReference<>` type inference and `List<?>.contains(...)`. Fixed with explicit `new TypeReference<List<Map<String, Object>>>() {}` and `@SuppressWarnings("unchecked") List<String> flaggedWords = (List<String>) ...`.
- **Unique index `ux_reviews_activity_author` violation** in test data: fixed by using different students per review.
- **Flaky queue size** due to shared DB: filter returned queue by `eventId` before asserting.
- **Stale `CertificateRequestIT`** (pre-existing at HEAD): `CreateCertificateRequest.deliveryMethod` is now `@NotNull`; `APPROVED` maps to `READY`, and `READY` requires an uploaded PDF. Added `"deliveryMethod":"PICKUP"` to `createRequest` (8 → 3 failures); the remaining 3 are workflow-expectation mismatches and were left for a separate decision.
- **No local `npm`/`node`**: frontend is verified via `docker compose build nginx`.
- **Shell quirks**: zsh glob errors with unquoted `--include=*.java` (quote patterns); memory system is unavailable ("Failed to store memory").

#### **Current Work and Next Step**

**Current Work:**
The user approved the plan with "Proceed." I created the new todo list (7 items, all not completed). I re-read the reel effect in `frontend/src/pages/CampusPages.tsx` (lines 1210–1289) to start editing the case-opening animation. No files have been modified yet for this task.

**Next Step:**
1. Rewrite the reel `useEffect` + add a small helper (winner-card geometry via DOM, overshoot 24–64 px, settle to exact center, highlight `winnerIndex`, keep reduced-motion).
2. Create `backend/src/main/java/com/ptu/backend/dev/DevDemoDataSeeder.java` (`@Profile("dev")`, idempotent JdbcTemplate seeding): 8 groups, teachers/organizer/students with profiles and `academic_rating`, wallets, inventory cases/cosmetics, 6–8 themed cases with 5–8 weighted rewards and generated gradient PNGs, full 50-level pass (free cases + premium cosmetics), 8–10 workspace tasks with submissions, schedule entries, 5–6 events with participations/reviews (some `PENDING_MODERATION`), certificate requests; `@Order` the two runners so `DevDataSeeder` runs first.
3. Verify via `docker compose build nginx`, backend compile/tests, and `docker compose up -d --build backend`; then write `docs/demo-data.md` and a concise `docs/agent-log.md` entry.

